SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                2000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  0
PrintEvery                    50
PrintPropertiesEvery          50
Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
Restart File                  no
CutOff                        {cutoff:.2f}

Framework 0 
            FrameworkName                 simulation
            RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel no
            UseChargesFromCIFFile         yes
            UnitCells                     {na:d} {nb:d} {nc:d}
            ExternalTemperature           298.0
            ExternalPressure              7e6
	    Movies                        No

Component 0 MoleculeName                  CO2
            MoleculeDefinition            local
            IdealRosenbluthValue          1.0
            WidomProbability              1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules       0

Component 1 MoleculeName                  H2
            MoleculeDefinition            local
            IdealRosenbluthValue          1.0
            WidomProbability              1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules       0

Component 2 MoleculeName                  N2
            MoleculeDefinition            local
            IdealRosenbluthValue          1.0
            WidomProbability              1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules       0

Component 3 MoleculeName                  CO
            MoleculeDefinition            local
            IdealRosenbluthValue          1.0
            WidomProbability              1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules       0

Component 4 MoleculeName                  CH4
            MoleculeDefinition            local
            IdealRosenbluthValue          1.0
            WidomProbability              1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules       0
